#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:161
msgid "Anti-vibration mount for NAVIO2 can be found in this article"
msgstr "NAVIO2 的减震安装支架可在本文中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:5
#: 162fe4e1d67e4a6d911e75840a3f1664
msgid "NAVIO2 Assembly and Wiring Quick Start"
msgstr "NAVIO2 组装与接线快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:7
#: 6189a9e096f14ac9a759009d8df10e7b
msgid ""
"This article provides information about attaching :ref:`NAVIO2 <common-"
"navio2-overview>` to a Raspberry Pi,  powering and connecting its most "
"important peripherals."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将 :ref:`NAVIO2 <common-navio2-overview>` 安装到 Raspberry Pi "
"上，以及如何为其供电并连接最重要的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:12
#: 1b1c3c85c78242eba0a2fd4bcb571911
msgid "Attaching NAVIO2 to a Raspberry Pi"
msgstr "将 NAVIO2 安装到 Raspberry Pi 上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:14
#: 362ebbad849c4d068d4a9297a4bf48e3
msgid "ArduPilot on Navio2 is working on:"
msgstr "NAVIO2 上的 ArduPilot 支持以下平台："

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:16
#: 29d0c1ca1ecb47469188798d1fe3522e
msgid "Raspberry Pi 3 Model B"
msgstr "Raspberry Pi 3 Model B"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:17
#: 5bf68b6fb80049b6aecd0e4ecc1f7970
msgid "Raspberry Pi 2 Model B"
msgstr "Raspberry Pi 2 Model B"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:19
#: eb953d58d2754c11956e36f7cc11960e
msgid "To mount NAVIO2:"
msgstr "安装 NAVIO2 的步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:21
#: 44545abb01384cbe9015ccc600b8b6ed
msgid ""
"Install spacers to the top side of Raspberry Pi and fix them with screws "
"from the bottom."
msgstr "将铜柱安装到 Raspberry Pi 顶面，并从底部用螺丝固定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:22
#: 56ddafeb0557448a90b5b86a62e673ca
msgid "Connect extension header to the 40-pin gpio port."
msgstr "将扩展排针连接到 40 针 GPIO 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:23
#: edafa40359b14e3591629a5c71913cb5
msgid "Attach NAVIO2 to the extension header."
msgstr "将 NAVIO2 插入扩展排针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:24
#: 6b6bcf8df714487f839a1b617d8f0fed
msgid "Fix NAVIO2 using screws."
msgstr "用螺丝固定 NAVIO2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:31
#: 9805808e006e4020ad4e0b631755a753
msgid ""
"Raspberry Pi2 requires an external USB Wi-Fi dongle. An extensive list of "
"supported dongles is available `here <http://elinux.org/RPi_USB_Wi-"
"Fi_Adapters>`__."
msgstr ""
"Raspberry Pi 2 需要外接 USB Wi-Fi 适配器。支持的适配器详细列表可参见 `这里 "
"<http://elinux.org/RPi_USB_Wi-Fi_Adapters>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:38
#: 55e1d779cdf2409ba9fd31bdba5f3d9a
msgid "Powering NAVIO2"
msgstr "为 NAVIO2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:40
#: 68bbdde972e74a798e8815358eed0a66
msgid ""
"Navio2 has three power sources, all of them can be used simultaneously as "
"they are protected by ideal diodes."
msgstr "Navio2 有三种供电方式，均由理想二极管保护，可同时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:42
#: f66f4d94b0f3403bbf999302fca995a9
msgid ""
"For testing and development purposes: Connect 5V 1A power adapter to the "
"Raspberry Pi's microUSB port. Raspberry Pi will provide power to the NAVIO2."
msgstr ""
"用于测试和开发：将 5V 1A 电源适配器连接到 Raspberry Pi 的 micro USB 接口。Raspberry Pi 将为 NAVIO2 "
"供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:45
#: 81fb56eac9ab4f06a5e958ecb9d82a00
msgid ""
"In a drone: NAVIO2 should be powered by a power module connected to the "
"\"POWER\" port on NAVIO2. NAVIO2 will provide power to the Raspberry Pi."
msgstr ""
"在无人机上使用时：应通过连接到 NAVIO2 「POWER」端口的电源模块为 NAVIO2 供电。NAVIO2 将为 Raspberry Pi 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:51
#: 8d0f6730f1714be0a5e90b5794f24dc8
msgid ""
"Redundancy: In case of power module failure NAVIO2 will switch to power from"
" the servo rail."
msgstr "冗余：如果电源模块发生故障，NAVIO2 将切换至舵机供电轨供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:56
#: e4ce901d8d6540d7908f1d13a7698d25
msgid ""
"All power sources should provide voltage in 4.8-5.3V range, otherwise you "
"can damage your NAVIO2 and Raspberry Pi."
msgstr "所有电源的电压应在 4.8V 至 5.3V 范围内，否则可能损坏 NAVIO2 和 Raspberry Pi。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:61
#: ed95b6ae63ae49a19f590a5e8e13cb5d
msgid "Connect remote control inputs"
msgstr "连接遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:63
#: 6f204e7fd2f54540afdb4deba03d3da6
msgid ""
"NAVIO2 supports PPM and SBUS signals as an RC input. To connect receivers "
"that do not support PPM output you can use PPM encoder. PPM receiver is "
"powered by NAVIO2 and does not require power on the servo rail."
msgstr ""
"NAVIO2 支持 PPM 和 SBUS 信号作为 RC 输入。若要连接不支持 PPM 输出的接收机，可使用 PPM 编码器。PPM 接收机由 "
"NAVIO2 供电，无需在舵机供电轨上单独供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:67
#: 056ae2c3c42d4957bba383162300cbe1
msgid ""
"Do not connect servos to the RC receiver! Servos can consume a lot of power "
"which RC receiver port may not be able to provide and that may lead to "
"Raspberry Pi and NAVIO2 shutting down and even getting damaged."
msgstr ""
"请勿将舵机连接到 RC 接收机！舵机耗电量较大，RC 接收机端口可能无法提供足够的电流，这可能导致 Raspberry Pi 和 NAVIO2 "
"关机甚至损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:69
#: ff03b0dd761d42cb8eb682ce37b1b4e7
msgid "Some of the receivers with PPM output:"
msgstr "部分支持 PPM 输出的接收机："

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:71
#: cb30399de9344364bb38a637c6ac286b
msgid "For ACCST (most FrSky transmitters):"
msgstr "适用于 ACCST 协议（大多数 FrSky 遥控器）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:73
#: 3dba5bfea8f144a68d11b1e53c602f48
msgid "FrSky D4R-II 4ch 2.4Ghz ACCST Receiver"
msgstr "FrSky D4R-II 4 通道 2.4GHz ACCST 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:74
#: 383d2a1b489b436690255db8cb21a714
msgid "FrSKY V8R7-SP ACCST 7 Channel RX with composite PPM"
msgstr "FrSKY V8R7-SP ACCST 7 通道带复合 PPM 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:75
#: e21ef61ca0ff48b8972c5c76e66b954a
msgid "FrSKY D8R-XP"
msgstr "FrSKY D8R-XP"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:77
#: 40f198d5ba8d4840b8a248a1538a84bb
msgid "For FASST (Futaba & some FrSky trasmitters):"
msgstr "适用于 FASST 协议（Futaba 及部分 FrSky 遥控器）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:79
#: 2fb20b2f15ff4724b6e063e818ac8428
msgid "FrSky TFR4 4ch 2.4Ghz Surface/Air Receiver FASST Compatible"
msgstr "FrSky TFR4 4 通道 2.4GHz 地面/空中 FASST 兼容接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:88
#: 4e9b7bb6aeb54024a4afa8fc013078e4
msgid "GNSS Antenna"
msgstr "GNSS 天线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:90
#: d9063959825f4323b616345d67229c25
msgid "GNSS antenna is plugged into the MCX port on top of NAVIO2."
msgstr "GNSS 天线接入 NAVIO2 顶部的 MCX 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:99
#: a220427d1091420f86e7d003c5d5c3b8
msgid "Connect Motors"
msgstr "连接电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:101
#: c3be4e274fda41d98d0b42bf5e0f0e03
msgid ""
"ESCs are connected to RC outputs labeled from 1 to 14 on a 2.54mm header."
msgstr "ESC 连接到 2.54mm 排针上标有 1 至 14 的 RC 输出接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:106
#: d49cfd57cdbe453cb867332d05a120b4
msgid ""
"For typical ESCs setup schemes visit `NAVIO2 documentation "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-APM/typical-setup-schemes/>`__ which "
"includes copter, plane, rover setups."
msgstr ""
"典型 ESC 接线方案（包括多旋翼、固定翼、地面车辆配置）请访问 `NAVIO2 文档 "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-APM/typical-setup-schemes/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:111
#: ee07182518a348d7a2346a64f3320d04
msgid ""
"Only one ESC power wire (central) should be connected to Navio2 servo rail, "
"otherwise BECs built in ESCs will heat each other."
msgstr "舵机供电轨只应连接一根 ESC 电源线（中间线），否则各 ESC 内置的 BEC 会相互加热。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:114
#: 875c5bb718664cec8075714ffb0b9721
msgid "Connect other peripherals"
msgstr "连接其他外设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:116
#: 2c660d9e2f934e9190a27329e91db185
msgid ""
"Depending on your hardware there may be any number of other peripherals "
"attached, including sensors, cameras, grippers etc."
msgstr "根据您的硬件配置，可能还需连接多种其他外设，包括传感器、摄像头、夹持器等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:120
#: d9d8de6663af4b439b9a1926c2c6bdc3
msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr "数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:121
#: 67210b1a2cce40b9bd788c1e777ffe8b
msgid "Radio modems can be connected either over UART or over USB."
msgstr "无线电调制解调器可通过 UART 或 USB 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:123
#: 70f6475b356248658b5bd62ac539d582
msgid "UART radio"
msgstr "UART 无线电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:125
#: 2c69e5fd11e0446094f9fa512908c308
msgid "For UART port use /dev/ttyAMA0 serial."
msgstr "使用 UART 端口时，请使用 /dev/ttyAMA0 串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:130
#: 1ff9526b5ad84f5fb151a5a1883d9f07
msgid "USB radio"
msgstr "USB 无线电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:132
#: ecbee2ea78fb4354ba3705f4a1bd97e9
msgid "Use /dev/ttyUSB0 virtual serial port for USB."
msgstr "USB 连接请使用 /dev/ttyUSB0 虚拟串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:139
#: bf150d4bef6645d39b0df8c42d985508
msgid "Servos"
msgstr "舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:141
#: 6778e5c715d94ef7af285d88b08902b5
msgid ""
"Servos are connected to RC outputs labeled from 1 to 14 on a 2.54mm header."
msgstr "舵机连接到 2.54mm 排针上标有 1 至 14 的 RC 输出接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:150
#: afd10a90ba2f46c3902fcb54d00882ed
msgid ""
"Power module does not provide power to servos. To provide power to servos "
"connect BEC to the servo rail. BEC would also serve as back-up power supply "
"to Navio2."
msgstr "电源模块不为舵机供电。若需为舵机供电，请将 BEC 连接至舵机供电轨。BEC 同时也作为 Navio2 的备用电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:155
#: 0b3f2444a7734da19a05268cdc921655
msgid "Related information"
msgstr "相关信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:158
#: ddaa3ee55d6d4308994065cd031abb73
msgid ""
"Detailed information for NAVIO2 configuration and setup can be found in "
"`documentation <https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/>`__."
msgstr "NAVIO2 的详细配置和安装信息可在 `文档 <https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/>`__ 中找到。"
